#
# Build-host accommodation — NOT a device optimization. Merged LAST.
# Stock crDroid uses full LTO (CONFIG_LTO_CLANG=y, THINLTO off), whose final link
# needs ~8-12 GB RAM. This build host has 7.5 GB. ThinLTO keeps LTO's benefits with
# near-identical runtime but a fraction of the link memory, so the build completes
# reliably here. LTO stays ON (just thin instead of full).
#
CONFIG_THINLTO=y
